    "why_it_matters": "The most-cited address in Gangtok for traditional Sikkimese-Nepali cooking — name means 'invitation' in Nepali. Interiors use traditional earthen pots and stoves; the kitchen runs nakimo ka torkari, sandheko, mutton pakku and the buckwheat-rice-millet Sikkimese thali that most tourist menus skip.",
